{"3837820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SnowJob", "steam_appid": 3837820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4967330], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP HORROR IN A FROZEN ANOMALOUS ZONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/461a680cace2bee59a9d23e922127a9c.poster.avif?t=1785855017\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/461a680cace2bee59a9d23e922127a9c.webm?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/461a680cace2bee59a9d23e922127a9c.mp4?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four players land in the zone, hunting for artifacts buried under the snow. Follow the signals, dig where it looks wrong and get out before the storm catches up. Nobody knows what's under the snow until it's already out.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SNOW YOU CAN SHAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/3b218e2a26051263be28b07666b568ea.poster.avif?t=1785855017\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/3b218e2a26051263be28b07666b568ea.webm?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/3b218e2a26051263be28b07666b568ea.mp4?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snow here is fully physical. Dig through it, pack it into a wall or bury yourself in a drift to disappear for a second. It's often the only thing between you and the storm.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEARCH &amp; SCAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/08a11ae79c5eda658d649e72af029177.poster.avif?t=1785855017\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/08a11ae79c5eda658d649e72af029177.webm?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/08a11ae79c5eda658d649e72af029177.mp4?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every artifact has to be dug up and scanned before it counts toward the quota. Scanning isn't quiet, and whatever's living underground doesn't need to see you to find you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEPER NIGHTS, HIGHER STAKES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/664ca1a8a372b165d682e03a3b06f413.poster.avif?t=1785855017\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/664ca1a8a372b165d682e03a3b06f413.webm?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/664ca1a8a372b165d682e03a3b06f413.mp4?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every expedition runs from sunset to dawn, and the quota gets harder to ignore each night. Dig deeper for better loot, and the caves get warmer, darker and far more dangerous. Miss the quota or miss the extraction, and the expedition is over.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP HORROR IN A FROZEN ANOMALOUS ZONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/461a680cace2bee59a9d23e922127a9c.poster.avif?t=1785855017\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/461a680cace2bee59a9d23e922127a9c.webm?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/461a680cace2bee59a9d23e922127a9c.mp4?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four players land in the zone, hunting for artifacts buried under the snow. Follow the signals, dig where it looks wrong and get out before the storm catches up. Nobody knows what's under the snow until it's already out.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SNOW YOU CAN SHAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/3b218e2a26051263be28b07666b568ea.poster.avif?t=1785855017\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/3b218e2a26051263be28b07666b568ea.webm?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/3b218e2a26051263be28b07666b568ea.mp4?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snow here is fully physical. Dig through it, pack it into a wall or bury yourself in a drift to disappear for a second. It's often the only thing between you and the storm.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEARCH &amp; SCAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/08a11ae79c5eda658d649e72af029177.poster.avif?t=1785855017\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/08a11ae79c5eda658d649e72af029177.webm?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/08a11ae79c5eda658d649e72af029177.mp4?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every artifact has to be dug up and scanned before it counts toward the quota. Scanning isn't quiet, and whatever's living underground doesn't need to see you to find you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEPER NIGHTS, HIGHER STAKES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/664ca1a8a372b165d682e03a3b06f413.poster.avif?t=1785855017\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/664ca1a8a372b165d682e03a3b06f413.webm?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837820/extras/664ca1a8a372b165d682e03a3b06f413.mp4?t=1785855017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every expedition runs from sunset to dawn, and the quota gets harder to ignore each night. Dig deeper for better loot, and the caves get warmer, darker and far more dangerous. Miss the quota or miss the extraction, and the expedition is over.</strong></p>", "short_description": "SnowJob is a 4-pl